        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>人民日报 金句摘抄 · 心态主题</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body { margin:0; padding:0; }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\", \"Source Han Serif SC\", serif;\n    background: #cfc5b4;\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  /* ===== Header band ===== */\n  .header {\n    background: #f7efe8;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 18px 22px 14px 26px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .logo { text-align: left; }\n  .logo .title {\n    font-family: \"STKaiti\", \"KaiTi\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 56px;\n    color: #c0271d;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n  .logo .pinyin {\n    margin-top: 8px;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: 5px;\n    color: #c0271d;\n  }\n  .header-right { text-align: right; }\n  .header-right .line1 {\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n  }\n  .header-right .line1 .sep {\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    margin: 0 8px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n  .header-right .line2 {\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    border-top: 3px solid #1a1a1a;\n    padding-top: 8px;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n\n  /* ===== Body content ===== */\n  .content {\n    padding: 26px 24px 30px 24px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .quote {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #141414;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n  }\n  .quote-1 { font-size: 33px; margin-bottom: 22px; }\n  .quote-2 { font-size: 27px; margin: 26px 0 18px 0; }\n\n  .label {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #2b2b2b;\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  .explain {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    color: #1f1f1f;\n    text-align: justify;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"logo\">\n      <div class=\"title\">人民日报</div>\n      <div class=\"pinyin\">RENMIN RIBAO</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"header-right\">\n      <div class=\"line1\">金句<span class=\"sep\">│</span>摘抄</div>\n      <div class=\"line2\">心态主题</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n\n    <div class=\"quote quote-1\">\n      且行且忘且随风，<br>\n      且行且看且从容。\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"label\">释义:</p>\n    <p class=\"explain\">\n      意思是顺风而行，轻松的走着;边走边观察，不慌不忙，从容不迫。引申意思就是当我们]遇到非常不平静的时候，只要能有-一个平静的心态，才能找出平静的办法去解决，讲的是从容面对的淡定心态。人生百味，浓缩到最后，就是一个淡字，正确地选择与取舍，是一生必修的功课。\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"quote quote-2\">\n      我将玫瑰藏于身后风起花落，<br>\n      从此鲜花赠自己，<br>\n      纵马踏花向自由。\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"label\">释义:</p>\n    <p class=\"explain\">\n      我把心中的美好向往藏在身后，当面对现实的时候美好的向往会随着花儿掉落，而从此以后美好赠送给自己，骑着马儿迎着美好向往自由。\n    </p>\n\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
